# Bootstrap package for role management application concerns.
#
# The Role entity is owned by the devflow-auth module:
#   com.devflow.modules.auth.domain.Role
#
# This package holds application-level role management adapters:
# role assignment, role validation utilities, and role-to-permission
# resolution used in the Security Filter Chain and method-level
# authorization annotations.
#
# Reference: docs/security/AUTHORIZATION_MODEL.md §5 (RBAC)
